  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Translation in one oblique 3D coordinate frame: the directed displacement from M to M1 equals the independent vector p. Source-first; all strokes are solid. Modern regularization uses an exact common projected displacement, with no displayed numeric components.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-g10-12.png",
      "sha256": "864217b817cc42714bb768ab91308fc48ae176a30b50a636e05696967ef25ed8"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n46",
        "text": "1. 假设给定了直角坐标系和空间的变换$f$. 可以提出问题：推出根据任意点$M$的坐标计算它的象$f(M)$的坐标公式. 这样的公式叫做变换的坐标公式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n46",
        "text": "问题1. 求平移(向量$\\vec{p}=(a,b,c)$的坐标公式."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c2-s1-n46",
        "text": "解. 我们研究任意点$M(x,y,z)$和它的象$M_1(x_1,y_1,z_1)$(图12). 从条件$\\vec{p}(M)=M_1$得出$\\overrightarrow{MM_1}=\\vec{p}$. 将这个等式变为坐标形式(§44，习题2)，得到：\n$x_1-x=a$，\n$y_1-y=b$，$z_1-z$ $=c$. 由此，得：\n$x_1=a+x$，\n\n$y_1=b+y$，$z_1=c+z$."
      }
    ],
